      "key": "073fe02",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Вы нашли бельгийский флаг! Возвращайтесь в Бельгию.",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the Belgian flag! Go back to Belgium.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_073fe02.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3370,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:59Z",
      "textHash": "0bf7d041bf769e7880448cff6a7c668505638917383fcc8f96686bf592a64dd5"
    },
    {
      "key": "0768ab7",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_switzerland",
      "sourceText": "Флаг Швейцарии.",
      "sourceEnText": "Flag of Switzerland.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0768ab7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1280,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:22Z",
      "textHash": "dc8d4c188dbdccb06253bb769946a8c2e0414a24fccfe51f03bbfb77201e52b9"
    },
    {
      "key": "079096a",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Спасибо! Мой флаг вернулся!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you! My flag is back!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_079096a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:17Z",
      "textHash": "79ca47156620c651e17af29324d6a3fc074ba8ae9b1a98e2127c9092ddda7f29"
    },
    {
      "key": "079ecca",
      "nodeTitle": "task_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Он черного, желтого и красного цветов с вертикальными полосами.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's black, yellow, and red with vertical stripes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_079ecca.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 4049,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:25Z",
      "textHash": "e8f2a038bcddfd4bb243c318fefc1068ec3cffe6839f23fd89edd8108d62a0c0"
    },
    {
      "key": "07cc57e",
      "nodeTitle": "task_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Он красный с большим белым крестом, как аптечка первой помощи.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is red with a big white cross like a first aid kit.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_07cc57e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 4049,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:07Z",
      "textHash": "7df039b72e0a7f1d824489933a3e617520f1b4b00e159e255464ece73f5a80e3"
    },
    {
      "key": "081ac66",
      "nodeTitle": "italy_npc",
      "sourceText": "Грацие! Это мой флаг!",
      "sourceEnText": "Grazie! That's my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_081ac66.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:07Z",
      "textHash": "4043c3299b12e4cc1a0fb617e707fa44117aaf45f31727d9bab3de7d4c4cab60"
    },
    {
      "key": "0868737",
      "nodeTitle": "task_france",
      "sourceText": "Мой флаг сине-бело-красный.",
      "sourceEnText": "It's blue, white, and red.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0868737.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:32Z",
      "textHash": "c3c5d4b33f206e7aef30c707c596d869c6e3208618e5f551c3fe96aa9446f57f"
    },
    {
      "key": "08a09de",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Давайте встретимся с друзьями из соседних стран.",
      "sourceEnText": "Let’s meet friends from nearby countries.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_08a09de.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3135,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:44Z",
      "textHash": "f2fded868f3da5ff3ba5c3dcdd730406ca8798f824a3a33ab01d547589f695c5"
    },
    {
      "key": "08a8ce8",
      "nodeTitle": "quest_start",
      "sourceText": "Мы в Европе.",
      "sourceEnText": "We are in Europe.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_08a8ce8.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1045,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:42Z",
      "textHash": "00d88c12e872abdbb39d171bc2371a460a98655232aadab01a321a8dffc2041f"
    },
    {
      "key": "091cc7c",
      "nodeTitle": "task_spain",
      "sourceText": "Найдите испанский флаг.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find the Spanish flag.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_091cc7c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1646,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:02Z",
      "textHash": "e14a827a8fd351a388e560296c05c5b8522cbc331848cf0e889ae6768ce7992b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0930602",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Спасибо. Можете передать моему другу из Люксембурга его флаг?",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you. Can you give my Luxembourg friend their flag?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0930602.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3918,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:55Z",
      "textHash": "ef687449853eee8ad1bafd58ffcec0080d4f845f30dfa6ffef5ea333c9bea884"
    },
    {
      "key": "09635b4",
      "nodeTitle": "task_spain",
      "sourceText": "Он красный и желтый, как солнце.",
      "sourceEnText": "It is red and yellow like the sun.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09635b4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2142,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:03Z",
      "textHash": "1b827afa9d549bc3f86bc38af45431f72e7520000f25acef46f2a9fe16ffe93e"
    },
    {
      "key": "09cf6c9",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Мадрид — столица Испании.",
      "sourceEnText": "Madrid is the capital of Spain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09cf6c9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 2299,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:52Z",
      "textHash": "90f504b59a362a3486a1ab1dcaea526efe901ed28f4eb90ebaae5f5472d41425"
    },
    {
      "key": "09fe8fc",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Привет! Я из Швейцарии!",
      "sourceEnText": "Hello! I’m from Switzerland!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_09fe8fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:02Z",
      "textHash": "bc0370a79863d792a5de2e4525fce6439d3dafde0e26fad9ad3f8c126c1b9f2f"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a20eed",
      "nodeTitle": "france_npc",
      "sourceText": "Антура перепутала все флаги!",
      "sourceEnText": "We have a problem. Antura mixed up all the flags!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a20eed.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:31Z",
      "textHash": "a57506b713a7c5f77b8d02c18b6b302c19125d69af3f057b60e760c93a337900"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a23cce",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_italy",
      "sourceText": "На карте Италия выглядит как сапог!",
      "sourceEnText": "Italy looks like a boot on the map!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a23cce.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:31:11Z",
      "textHash": "8d3e718bd94f6494f337afc148ac733877c486fbe987a2ce9001dafef91c3293"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a3d0e3",
      "nodeTitle": "luxembourg_npc",
      "sourceText": "Мы небольшая страна, и мы говорим на трёх языках!",
      "sourceEnText": "We are a small country and speak three languages!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a3d0e3.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 2978,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:28:51Z",
      "textHash": "49e308da08f4c001fd4a6e8a568cc8211bd9efbad1e6e949620f257bb5f42087"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a3f8f6",
      "nodeTitle": "monaco",
      "sourceText": "Бонжур! Я из Монако!",
      "sourceEnText": "Bonjour! I’m from Monaco!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a3f8f6.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1933,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:09Z",
      "textHash": "e9771bf6d9d3714feda9e084f0b18216933196cfa9b677c93eb5000a4e9e20b5"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a61b67",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Бонжур! Я из Бельгии!",
      "sourceEnText": "Bonjour! I'm from Belgium!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a61b67.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:20Z",
      "textHash": "a1a40d1863324002b0d4eaa7d1bb4749352a187d9fe4505afa7ef62b06421fcd"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9b166",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_france",
      "sourceText": "Вы нашли французский флаг! Вернитесь к французу.",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the French flag! Go back to the French man.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a9b166.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:53Z",
      "textHash": "f478da9c0b235feebb5507fcc6cef39a14389ed3c6b3bd3ca0772d86005e438c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a9f34e",
      "nodeTitle": "france_npc",
      "sourceText": "Вы можете помочь мне?",
      "sourceEnText": "Can you help us?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0a9f34e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:34Z",
      "textHash": "9927bc57f612cbbf5330e6d3f43a365d4eb111f155571544ce0138900037313e"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ab3dd9",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_france",
      "sourceText": "Франция — вторая по величине страна в Европе после Украины.",
      "sourceEnText": "France is the second biggest country in the Europe after Ukraine.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ab3dd9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:50Z",
      "textHash": "e0e12ce8c5cebdb45fe87a2c81746765ff7beb79bfa069cb13cadf57348025de"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b11066",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_belgium",
      "sourceText": "Флаг Бельгии.",
      "sourceEnText": "Flag of Belgium.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b11066.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1097,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:27Z",
      "textHash": "fc27ac7f9c9c86bfc4e57cc2fb8ced36fcabe33ffa61e1324cf22315bd303fae"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b18893",
      "nodeTitle": "belgium_npc",
      "sourceText": "Мы также говорим по-французски!",
      "sourceEnText": "We also speak French!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b18893.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_F",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:22Z",
      "textHash": "752a6e58e034c257d3d338506bf609af691c8107e31c974c3a734b4e04d591ed"
    },
    {
      "key": "0b22d58",
      "nodeTitle": "luxembourg_npc",
      "sourceText": "Мойен! Я из Люксембурга!",
      "sourceEnText": "Moien! I’m from Luxembourg!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0b22d58.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "SENIOR_M",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:33Z",
      "textHash": "79b5e96594a2e6ae9db7dd2a5b49f4d5eac60bf845e798087624791f544d5dba"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba3c4c",
      "nodeTitle": "win",
      "sourceText": "Молодец! У тебя получилось!",
      "sourceEnText": "Good job! You did it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ba3c4c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_F",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:28:50Z",
      "textHash": "09d2b5b3e72e0d16cfe7cc76788f5cb764fade55a622e5f91db28e1090604bfb"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ba8707",
      "nodeTitle": "germany_npc",
      "sourceText": "Данке! Это мой флаг!",
      "sourceEnText": "Danke! That is my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ba8707.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1776,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:40Z",
      "textHash": "a76f6dfc04757569f2dd4d6dad0b9f6109a319c251cf86382987c24d0a634d77"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bda0fc",
      "nodeTitle": "italy_npc",
      "sourceText": "Чао! Я из Италии!",
      "sourceEnText": "Ciao! I'm from Italy!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0bda0fc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 1593,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:11Z",
      "textHash": "01020541f598d9a27e9c404ad98f7bd33f9291cf2d3ff97a6684e0e0e07c00c5"
    },
    {
      "key": "0bf6b0d",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Мы славимся заснеженными горами и сыром.",
      "sourceEnText": "We're famous for snowy mountains and cheese.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0bf6b0d.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:04Z",
      "textHash": "350153608cf7fa47f7a52e87b1fa53ad20329c138f5081886d6264b31624ea5b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c097e4",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_france",
      "sourceText": "Во Франции находится Эйфелева башня, гигантская железная башня, которая сверкает ночью.",
      "sourceEnText": "In France there is the Eiffel Tower, a giant iron tower that sparkles at night.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c097e4.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 6191,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:31:06Z",
      "textHash": "5f0adbe1a3cf721e14c3716e2ed89e8d13bc32ad2cc62ce556b506e0b38b5490"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c48a14",
      "nodeTitle": "post_quest_activity",
      "sourceText": "Можете ли вы теперь нарисовать свой флаг?",
      "sourceEnText": "Can you draw your flag now?",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c48a14.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:47Z",
      "textHash": "a0015a834512d1cf21322907cc95bedc85eb17b1a31a4e9e940a98b63999b840"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c57e40",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Это мой флаг!",
      "sourceEnText": "That is my flag!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0c57e40.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:54Z",
      "textHash": "3b1d1c88440bef572da84906d2d14b7a41ea59be908517b2159aa101a6df7d63"
    },
    {
      "key": "0ca99a0",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Спасибо, что вернули мой флаг!",
      "sourceEnText": "Thank you for bringing my flag back!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0ca99a0.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1829,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:28:59Z",
      "textHash": "cb4aab25a9388fb04f5cdce588302630c8bc898bf69878bfec183a0bc3a8d514"
    },
    {
      "key": "0caad5a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Наш флаг красный с белым крестом.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag is red with a white cross.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0caad5a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:01Z",
      "textHash": "91ee2eb79512b68c1d89e45b87968b185b6d8e2a69b5f1f5d7629ee8b2e20794"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cd7024",
      "nodeTitle": "germany_npc",
      "sourceText": "Наш флаг имеет чёрные, красные и жёлтые полосы.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag has black, red and yellow stripes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0cd7024.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 3318,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:44Z",
      "textHash": "a4f0c4b3cc1e5d5b4266eb90b5237d2c3685f2470dd2ca9bb93c4a61b122b9e9"
    },
    {
      "key": "0cde44c",
      "nodeTitle": "task_italy",
      "sourceText": "Он зеленый, белый и красный, как пицца!",
      "sourceEnText": "It is green, white, and red like a pizza!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0cde44c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "KID_M",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:14Z",
      "textHash": "d4f395c098e096a297844e796adfbcd1e90823aa60657f1947a956a28880e1f6"
    },
    {
      "key": "0d2e2d7",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Столица Швейцарии — Берн!",
      "sourceEnText": "The capital of Switzerland is Bern!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0d2e2d7.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 4702,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:28:58Z",
      "textHash": "f1e02ced675247dc2be06647b19240d979a56881ec9479eaf65b6a8745d7c48b"
    },
    {
      "key": "0db05da",
      "nodeTitle": "spain_npc",
      "sourceText": "Не мой! Наш флаг красно-жёлтый.",
      "sourceEnText": "Our flag is red and yellow.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0db05da.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 2247,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:29:57Z",
      "textHash": "54adbfa79472fb86f20bbb108ae3a3f98a6bcf9d00a9eef5f6332eb02c07d6ac"
    },
    {
      "key": "0dc2c74",
      "nodeTitle": "item_flag_italy",
      "sourceText": "Вы нашли итальянский флаг! Возвращайтесь в Италию.",
      "sourceEnText": "You found the Italian flag! Go back to Italy.",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0dc2c74.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "NARRATOR",
      "durationMs": 3500,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T01:30:58Z",
      "textHash": "c88c3b48f3cb0b4d6d306038b0d83dd59d9f0f15a29c20709487821a876dda9c"
    },
    {
      "key": "0dc315a",
      "nodeTitle": "monaco",
      "sourceText": "Мы маленькая страна. У нас есть автогонки и дворец на берегу моря!",
      "sourceEnText": "We are a small country. We have car races and a palace by the sea!",
      "audioFile": "fr_00_0dc315a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
